        "original_id": "8c71579c-064d-53b9-b587-563169348a51",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Olympia Dukakis, Norman Jewison, John Patrick Shanley, George T. Miller, Sigrid Thornton\n- Works: Moonstruck, Over the Hill\n- Topics: film acting, film awards\n\nFacts:\n- In 1987, Olympia Dukakis transitioned to film acting and won an Academy Award and a Golden Globe, and received a BAFTA nomination, for her performance in \"Moonstruck.\"\n- In 1987, \"Moonstruck\" was released as an American romantic comedy film directed by Norman Jewison and written by John Patrick Shanley.\n- In 1992, \"Over the Hill\" was released as an Australian drama film directed by George T. Miller and starring Olympia Dukakis and Sigrid Thornton.",
